' ============================================================================
' 35 TensorLogic from end to end: the components from the FLT text to RSpace.
'
' Source of Figure TL1 in ../tensor-logic/README.md. The figure restates the
' design of tensor-logic/gslt.md (sections 6 to 10) and of
' tensor-logic/integration.md (sections 1 to 6). It adds no new fact.
'
' Reading order:
'   1. A Rholang 1.4 deploy holds TL terms as FLTs, such as tl:Score{...}.
'   2. The registry publishes the TL module, and rho:mettail:install installs
'      it, computes its fingerprint F and binds the handle tl.
'   3. F1r3lang lexes and parses each FLT body with the installed language,
'      and reflects the term to a Par whose tags carry F.
'   4. The reducer passes the reflected term as a value: in a VectorDB query,
'      as an argument of rho:lang:vector, or in free TensorCheck(...).
'   5. The TL engine decodes, normalizes, checks and evaluates the term, and
'      no meter covers that work (decision 89).
'   6. The VectorDB agent commits its COMMs to RSpace, and the theory seam
'      stores the identity of a TensorCheck theory in the config of a space.
'
' Colors come from concept-colors.iuml (aliases of the shared palette).
' Render: ./render.sh 35-tl-components.puml   Check: ./render.sh --check

@startuml 35-tl-components
!include ../../../casper/theory/diagrams/palette.iuml
!include concept-colors.iuml
$ca_base_skin()
skinparam ArrowColor $rrs_relation
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam PackageBorderColor $rrs_relation
skinparam ComponentBorderColor $rrs_relation
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor $rrs_relation
skinparam NoteBorderColor $rrs_relation
skinparam LegendBorderColor $rrs_relation
skinparam LegendBackgroundColor $ca_note_grey
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 50
title TensorLogic from end to end (the P12 design)

package "Rholang 1.4 deploy" as DEPLOY $rrs_tl_term {
  component FLT $rrs_tl_term [
  **TL terms as FLTs**
  tl:Score{ Emb[x, d] q[d] }
  tl:Program{ Y[i] = relu(W[i, j] X[j]) | Y? }
  tl:Check{ v : [D] in { min[d](v[d] >= 0) } }
  ]
}

package "F1r3lang (mettail-rust, owned by F1r3lang)" as F1R3LANG $rrs_f1r3lang {
  component REGISTRY $rrs_f1r3lang [
  **Versioned Registry**
  rho:lib:1.0.0:<publisher>:tensorlogic:1.0.0
  ]
  component INSTALL $rrs_f1r3lang [
  **rho:mettail:install**
  computes the fingerprint <latex>\mathcal{F}_{TL}</latex>
  and binds the handle tl
  ]
  component FRONTEND $rrs_f1r3lang [
  **FLT lexer and guest parser**
  the four TL tokens and the GSLT grammar
  ]
  component REFLECT $rrs_f1r3lang [
  **Reflection**
  EList[GPrivate("mettail.term.F.C"), ^gnd or ^nog, children]
  ]
}

package "Reducer and Reified runtime (this repository)" as RUNTIME $rrs_agent {
  component REDUCER $rrs_host [
  **Reducer**
  the term is a value inside the
  fields query_spec and params (decision 112)
  ]
  component AGENT $rrs_agent [
  **VectorDB agent** (TL-0 and TL-3)
  the keys score, tensors and precision
  ]
  component VEC $rrs_system [
  **rho:lang:vector** [0xE0, 0x23]
  eval, normalize, check, demand
  ]
  component SEAM $rrs_checker [
  **Theory seam**
  free TensorCheck(tl, check, p)
  ]
}

package "TL engine (native)" as ENGINE $rrs_tl_engine {
  component DECODE $rrs_tl_engine [
  **DECODE**
  parse_reflected_tag and the
  allow-list of fingerprints
  ]
  component NORMALIZE $rrs_tl_engine [
  **NORMALIZE**
  RESOLVE, INLINE, ELABORATE,
  SCOPE and CANON
  ]
  component CHECK $rrs_tl_engine [
  **CHECK**
  shapes, the scope rule, safety,
  recursion classes, the demand bound B
  ]
  component EVAL $rrs_tl_engine [
  **EVALUATE**
  exact rationals, correctly rounded
  functions, semi-naive iteration
  ]
}

' Changed by decision 89: the node has no host-work budget, so the engine has no meter. The text before:
' component METER $rrs_meter [
' **Host-work meter** of the deploy
' a reservation before each step (decision 40)
' ]

database RSPACE $rrs_storage [
**RSpace**
records and COMMs, the config C(sid),
the content record <latex>\mathtt{E0} \Vert \mathtt{T} \Vert h</latex>
]

REGISTRY --> INSTALL : the module source
INSTALL --> FRONTEND : the installed language
FLT --> FRONTEND : the FLT body
FRONTEND --> REFLECT : the parsed term
REFLECT --> REDUCER : a reflected Par
REDUCER --> AGENT : a score query
REDUCER --> VEC : vec!?("eval", ...)
REDUCER --> SEAM : a factory call or a send
AGENT --> DECODE
VEC --> DECODE
SEAM --> DECODE
DECODE --> NORMALIZE
NORMALIZE --> CHECK
CHECK --> EVAL
' Changed by decision 89: the meter is gone, so this arrow has no target. The text before:
' EVAL -[$rrs_flow]-> METER : every phase reserves first
AGENT -[$rrs_effect]-> RSPACE : COMM
SEAM -[$rrs_effect]-> RSPACE : identity bytes and KIND T

legend bottom
**Concept colors**
|<$rrs_tl_term>  | TL terms: FLTs and their reflection |
|<$rrs_f1r3lang> | F1r3lang and the reducer: code that the design calls and never changes |
|<$rrs_agent>    | the space agent |
|<$rrs_tl_engine> | the TL engine, the capability and the theory checker: compiled-in code that decides values |
|<$rrs_storage>  | consensus state in RSpace |
endlegend
@enduml
